# Patches applied on every platform, before series.<platform>. Every entry
# must apply to both pinned trees: the n8.0.1 git checkout (apple, android,
# windows) and the 7.1 archive linux builds from (versions.json
# overrides.linux). Promote a per-platform patch here once a second platform
# needs the same pool file, instead of copying it into another series -- the
# pool entry stays the single source of truth and the resolved order stays
# series.common first.
